 "description": "List the membership plans the studio sells (subscriptions, class packs, money packs): pricing, duration, credits, usage limits, trial and intro-offer flags. Optionally only plans usable for a given session or appointment. Momence: GET /api/v2/host/memberships.",
 "inputSchema": {
